  not. `egm_port` 6511 is PickNik's default and the port the fake sends to. The IRB 1200 5/90 is
  the arm abb_ros2's own RobotStudio example uses; the IRB 120 elsewhere in this directory is the
  ROS 1 description with our tags and a mock (DRY-COVERAGE-PLAN.md Phase 8, item 8.4).

